        "en": "Quick start",
        "zh": "快速开始",
        "zh-Hant": "快速開始"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Install dsh, add this index, then install your first plugin.",
        "zh": "装好 dsh，添加这个索引，然后装第一个插件。",
        "zh-Hant": "裝好 dsh，加入這個索引，然後裝第一個外掛。"
      },
      "lines": [
        "xlings install dsh pnpm -y",
        "xlings config --index-repo dsh:https://github.com/Sunrisepeak/dsh-index.git",
